	RTR;RTR;RTR
	JMS TYPIT		/TYPE THE CHARACTER
	TAD I TERR
	JMS TYPIT
	ISZ TERR
	JMP TERR+1

TYPIT,	0
	AND (77			/ISOLATE THE CHARACTER
	SNA
	JMP CRLF		/0 TERMINATES IT
	DCA T3
